      "extract": "We have studied the Witten–Reshetikhin–Turaev invariant for the Brieskorn homology spheres (2.11) by use of properties of the Eichler integral of the half-integral weight based on the method of Ref. 23. The WRT invariant coincides with a limiting value of the Eichler integral at τ →1/N for N ∈Z, and the nearly modular property (4.17) of the Eichler integral gives an exact asymptotic behavior of the WRT invariant",
